; VGPU98 8x8 font, code page 437. Original design for this project.
; Used by 200-line graphics modes, 50-row text and INT 43h/1Fh. Format:
; spec/font-format.md.
;
; Metrics (rows 0-7):
;   capitals, digits and ascenders rows 0-5 (6 rows)
;   lower case x-height rows 2-5 (4 rows); i and j dots on row 0
;   descenders rows 6-7
;   accents: lower case rows 0-1; capitals with accents shrink to rows 1-5
; Strokes: vertical stems two pixels wide, horizontals one pixel. Letters use
; columns 0-6 and keep column 7 clear.
; Box drawing (B3h-DAh) follows the 'lines' positions below.

font 8x8
lines 3 2 4 3 2 4

